@startuml kairos-pastor-dashboard-sequence
title Pastor / Branch Leader Dashboard Load

actor Pastor
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Pastor -> WebAdmin: Open Dashboard
WebAdmin -> API: GET /dashboard/branch
API -> DB: Query branch metrics\n(branchMembers, attendance, outreach results,\nmissing lists)
DB --> API: Branch summary
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {branchSummary}

WebAdmin --> Pastor: Render branch dashboard

@enduml
